  "description": "TI BQ25731 buck-boost charge controller \u2014 FULL register map generated from SLUSE66A Rev A (Jan 2021) register tables. All current scalings for 10 mOhm sense resistors (RSR and RAC); halve codes / double mA for 5 mOhm. PSYS/CMPIN LSBs assume ADC_FULLSCALE=1b (3.06 V range, POR default).",
